  "You guessed {guess}; the {year} average was <strong>{real}</strong>": "Dijiste {guess}; el promedio de {year} fue <strong>{real}</strong>",
  "If it had simply kept pace with inflation since {year}, it would cost {price} — so this item {verdict}.": "Si solo hubiera seguido a la inflación desde {year}, costaría {price}; así que este producto {verdict}.",
